WEBVTT

00:04.254 --> 00:07.090
<i>The True Demon King has died.</i>

00:07.090 --> 00:11.011
<i>The enemy of the world
was defeated by somebody.</i>

00:11.011 --> 00:16.099
<i>But even now, the powers left behind
writhe in multitude.</i>

00:16.099 --> 00:19.352
<i>They cannot be subdued
by ordinary strength.</i>

00:19.352 --> 00:22.188
<i>A hundred</i> shura<i>-like demons...</i>

00:23.773 --> 00:29.362
<i>The world's largest city, Aureatia,
proceeds with the selection of a Hero,</i>

00:29.362 --> 00:32.949
<i>while the leader
of the New Principality of Lithia,</i>

00:32.949 --> 00:38.038
<i>Taren the Guarded, seeks new order,
and governs through fear.</i>

00:51.676 --> 00:55.055
ISHURA

02:09.045 --> 02:12.924
Episode 10
Vanishing Calamity

02:18.763 --> 02:24.978
New Principality of Lithia

02:40.577 --> 02:42.662
This one's for Mage City!

02:43.204 --> 02:45.874
Oh, no.

02:45.874 --> 02:48.376
Mage City was our city,
and you burnt it down.

02:48.376 --> 02:49.752
Die!

02:53.339 --> 02:55.675
Professor, the fire
has spread this way too.

02:56.843 --> 02:59.679
<i>Is this fire the result
of Mage City soldiers running riot?</i>

02:59.679 --> 03:01.431
<i>Or was somebody else responsible?</i>

03:01.431 --> 03:02.599
Professor!

03:07.729 --> 03:09.898
Look, women.

03:09.898 --> 03:11.649
They must be Lithia women.

03:11.649 --> 03:13.526
Stop already, they're not soldiers.

03:13.526 --> 03:14.611
Who cares!

03:15.904 --> 03:18.865
Lithia destroyed our city.

03:18.865 --> 03:19.949
They're just as guilty!

03:20.992 --> 03:23.328
<i>Mage City soldiers are on Aureatia's side.</i>

03:23.328 --> 03:25.079
<i>Getting rid of them would require</i>

03:25.079 --> 03:27.457
<i>a certain level of justification.</i>

03:28.041 --> 03:30.835
All right, ladies, don't move.

03:31.419 --> 03:32.545
Professor?

03:32.545 --> 03:33.838
Wait, Kia.

03:33.838 --> 03:35.673
Let me speak with them first.

03:35.673 --> 03:37.217
What's all this?

03:37.967 --> 03:38.968
Huh?

03:40.261 --> 03:42.680
Are you two really trying to pick up girls

03:42.680 --> 03:44.390
at a time like this?

03:44.390 --> 03:48.144
Sounds fun. Let me join in.

03:49.479 --> 03:52.148
This doesn't concern a construct like you!

03:59.906 --> 04:00.907
Now then,

04:01.908 --> 04:04.452
you two aren't from Lithia either,
are you?

04:05.161 --> 04:06.162
Who are you?

04:08.081 --> 04:09.415
Not talking, huh?

04:12.835 --> 04:14.921
You speak less than the dead.

04:17.799 --> 04:20.969
<i>If I can just get Kia to say "Die,"</i>

04:20.969 --> 04:23.304
<i>she could kill that construct too.</i>

04:23.805 --> 04:24.806
<i>But...</i>

04:25.390 --> 04:28.643
<i>can I get her to say it
faster than he moves?</i>

04:28.643 --> 04:30.436
I-I came here...

04:31.020 --> 04:34.274
...f-from the Eta Sylvan Province to study.

04:34.274 --> 04:36.776
This person is my professor.

04:36.776 --> 04:38.569
So that's why...

04:38.569 --> 04:39.988
Huh?

04:39.988 --> 04:42.657
You saved us, right?

04:43.324 --> 04:44.325
Thank you.

04:45.201 --> 04:46.202
However,

04:46.786 --> 04:48.830
you didn't have to kill them.

04:49.914 --> 04:50.915
Kia!

04:50.915 --> 04:52.417
Don't you think so too?

04:52.417 --> 04:54.502
They still hadn't done anything.

04:54.502 --> 04:56.838
I could have handled things better.

05:01.009 --> 05:02.510
Exactly.

05:02.510 --> 05:05.221
The little girl there is right.

05:08.182 --> 05:10.977
Lithia soldiers are evacuating citizens
on the east side.

05:11.561 --> 05:12.979
They'll get you out.

05:12.979 --> 05:15.148
The fires
still aren't burning strongly there.

05:15.898 --> 05:17.734
Can I ask your name?

05:18.484 --> 05:19.944
I no longer have it.

05:20.653 --> 05:22.864
The name I had when I was alive, that is.

05:23.531 --> 05:25.491
This way! Hurry!

05:25.491 --> 05:26.576
Hurry!

05:26.576 --> 05:28.369
Hurry and leave the city!

05:28.369 --> 05:30.538
Women and children first!
Don't push!

05:31.873 --> 05:35.001
Kia, I think
we should leave the city after all.

05:35.001 --> 05:36.085
But...

05:36.836 --> 05:39.339
I know you're worried about Lana.

05:39.339 --> 05:42.550
But you just saw how dangerous it is here.

05:43.843 --> 05:45.094
I know.

05:46.763 --> 05:48.765
<i>Kia knows nothing.</i>

05:49.307 --> 05:52.685
<i>If the past me had been like this girl...</i>

05:55.480 --> 05:58.524
<i>If there was just one adult
who I could trust...</i>

05:58.524 --> 06:01.277
<i>If I could have been unconcerned
with the evils of the world...</i>

06:03.363 --> 06:07.617
<i>No, in reality, everyone must fight
with their own strength.</i>

06:08.534 --> 06:11.537
<i>It's up to me to find happiness.</i>

06:11.537 --> 06:13.623
Even so, let me save her.

06:13.623 --> 06:16.000
Kia?

06:16.000 --> 06:18.378
I'm supposed to be capable of anything.

06:20.463 --> 06:23.758
There's no way I'll accept
not even being able to save a friend.

06:24.801 --> 06:26.594
This way! Hurry!

06:28.971 --> 06:31.974
If I don't do anything to help her now,

06:32.642 --> 06:35.228
I know I'll regret it when I'm an adult.

06:39.399 --> 06:42.485
So please come with me, Ms. Elea.

06:42.485 --> 06:44.987
Watch me do the right thing.

06:46.114 --> 06:47.782
Because I'm invincible.

06:47.782 --> 06:49.492
And I want to be happy.

06:54.080 --> 06:57.333
<i>There's no longer any reason
for me to kill Lana the Moon Tempest.</i>

06:58.334 --> 07:00.336
<i>I doubt she'll get an opportunity
to tell somebody</i>

07:00.336 --> 07:02.088
<i>about me and the World Word.</i>

07:03.172 --> 07:05.758
<i>But if I let Kia get her way,</i>

07:05.758 --> 07:09.637
<i>somebody might find out
that the World Word exists.</i>

07:13.057 --> 07:15.518
Kia, please listen to me--

07:15.518 --> 07:18.438
I want you to stay with me, Elea!

07:23.276 --> 07:25.278
Yes, I know.

07:29.907 --> 07:32.493
Looks like it's you
who taught me something.

07:33.995 --> 07:36.664
I'm proud to have you as my student, Kia.

07:44.797 --> 07:46.382
Kia!

07:49.469 --> 07:50.845
Stay away!

08:00.354 --> 08:01.606
Professor.

08:02.190 --> 08:03.900
Things will go back
to how they were, right?

08:03.900 --> 08:05.985
Like when there was peace.

08:05.985 --> 08:07.862
- I can't say...
- It has to.

08:07.862 --> 08:10.865
Because the city Lana loved got ruined.

08:11.532 --> 08:14.118
Right after she went through
a terrible ordeal.

08:16.496 --> 08:18.080
Don't you feel sorry for her?

08:18.664 --> 08:20.791
Yes, I really do.

08:23.544 --> 08:27.548
<i>Let's hope
everything goes back to how it was.</i>

08:34.347 --> 08:37.600
I was actually fond of that fountain.

08:43.648 --> 08:45.566
<i>The wyvern squad
has already been destroyed!</i>

08:45.566 --> 08:47.985
<i>They've broken through all defense lines.</i>
We're losing.

08:47.985 --> 08:49.820
<i>We've taken heavy damage!</i>

08:49.820 --> 08:53.407
<i>The fire is particularly bad,
and we have no way of extinguishing it.</i>

08:54.075 --> 08:56.160
<i>In addition, invading Mage City soldiers</i>

08:56.160 --> 08:57.245
<i>are massacring--</i>

09:05.711 --> 09:07.880
The other squads have all retreated.

09:08.548 --> 09:09.715
I'm the only one left.

09:09.715 --> 09:11.384
Is that so?

09:11.384 --> 09:13.970
Thank you for kindly informing me.

09:14.470 --> 09:16.514
But you should have retreated too.

09:16.514 --> 09:18.599
You must be kidding.

09:18.599 --> 09:20.601
The only reason I had them retreat,

09:20.601 --> 09:22.520
was to keep them out of my way.

09:22.520 --> 09:24.605
In such an interesting world,

09:24.605 --> 09:27.858
running away would be too much of a waste.

09:27.858 --> 09:29.443
All of this is mine.

09:29.443 --> 09:31.988
I see.

09:31.988 --> 09:34.782
Then watch carefully, right until the end.

09:35.366 --> 09:38.411
Watch as it all gets crushed to bits.

09:49.171 --> 09:51.007
<i>It's a construct.</i>

09:51.007 --> 09:53.384
<i>Just like the things I saw in Nagan,</i>

09:53.384 --> 09:57.388
<i>there's a core
keeping this tarantula thing alive.</i>

09:57.972 --> 09:59.849
<i>Is it in its torso?</i>

10:05.146 --> 10:07.440
<i>I need to kill what's inside this thing.</i>

10:08.149 --> 10:09.150
<i>So then,</i>

10:10.234 --> 10:11.402
<i>what's the plan?</i>

10:29.712 --> 10:32.256
Oh, boy, that armor is hard.

10:33.174 --> 10:35.593
You fight well, swordsman.

10:36.552 --> 10:38.471
But you can't beat me.

10:38.471 --> 10:40.222
Swordsman...

10:40.222 --> 10:41.891
Swordsman, huh?

10:43.184 --> 10:44.477
<i>I can't cut through that thing.</i>

10:45.061 --> 10:47.730
<i>I tried non-sword attacks too but...</i>

11:04.372 --> 11:06.040
A swordsman, you say?

11:06.957 --> 11:09.043
<i>Just who was it who pierced you before?</i>

11:18.427 --> 11:19.929
Right there.

11:19.929 --> 11:23.516
I was quite fond of that fountain.

11:23.516 --> 11:26.352
I like buildings and scenery.

11:26.352 --> 11:27.520
Since they can't be stolen.

11:37.530 --> 11:38.614
<i>A charge?</i>

11:39.198 --> 11:41.158
<i>No, it's moving differently from before.</i>

11:49.041 --> 11:50.376
<i>A web, I knew it.</i>

11:56.507 --> 11:58.259
I guess I'm in your web.

12:00.761 --> 12:03.264
Okay, time to die.

12:03.848 --> 12:05.766
For you it is.

12:35.588 --> 12:38.090
<i>Lord Dakai,
we've shone the Cold Star</i>

12:38.090 --> 12:39.216
<i>as you instructed.</i>

13:01.238 --> 13:02.406
Hmph.

13:09.997 --> 13:13.959
Ishura
Magic Item. Enchanted Sword

13:25.221 --> 13:26.639
You've got to be kidding me.

13:38.234 --> 13:41.237
Heat and impact attacks
have no effect on Helneten.

13:42.071 --> 13:44.490
Did you think
that would be enough to defeat me?

13:47.117 --> 13:48.327
<i>This isn't good.</i>

13:48.953 --> 13:52.331
<i>I lured that thing
into the water deliberately.</i>

13:52.915 --> 13:54.583
<i>I thought the gaps of the armor</i>

13:54.583 --> 13:57.711
<i>might start to bubble open
once the air heated up.</i>

13:58.295 --> 14:00.130
<i>But it's completely airtight.</i>

14:00.130 --> 14:02.132
<i>Isn't there a single airhole?</i>

14:02.132 --> 14:04.969
<i>How does whatever's inside stay alive?</i>

14:06.929 --> 14:08.639
<i>Suffocation is not an option.</i>

14:08.639 --> 14:10.474
<i>Submersion is pointless.</i>

14:10.474 --> 14:13.143
<i>The blade of my enchanted sword
can't penetrate it.</i>

14:13.143 --> 14:14.728
<i>Bury it and it will just come back up.</i>

14:15.312 --> 14:19.191
<i>Cutting it with its own thread won't work,
nor will targeting its joints.</i>

14:19.191 --> 14:21.360
<i>Even the Cold Star has no effect.</i>

14:25.489 --> 14:28.742
<i>Just how did someone manage
to cut this thing?</i>

14:30.536 --> 14:31.871
You are

14:31.871 --> 14:33.038
in the way!

14:43.090 --> 14:46.594
<i>So fun. This world is so fun.</i>

14:47.511 --> 14:50.097
All right, guess I'll give it a try.

14:56.270 --> 14:57.438
Are you alive?

14:57.438 --> 14:59.857
For some reason...

14:59.857 --> 15:02.526
...nobody seems to get it.

15:05.571 --> 15:08.324
I'm not a swordsman,

15:08.324 --> 15:10.618
I'm a bandit.

15:10.618 --> 15:14.413
Oh? We might get along well.

15:14.413 --> 15:17.541
You see,
I want to get along with the minians,

15:17.541 --> 15:19.627
but nobody understands!

15:20.836 --> 15:22.838
Look at this. For the first time,

15:22.838 --> 15:26.216
we managed to have a bit of a chat.

15:28.677 --> 15:29.803
Thread?

15:29.803 --> 15:32.890
What I really do best

15:32.890 --> 15:34.725
is stealing weapons...

15:38.771 --> 15:40.147
and opening locks!

15:46.487 --> 15:48.781
Huh?

15:54.453 --> 15:56.789
W-What did you do?

15:56.789 --> 15:59.291
A cute face, just as I imagined.

16:00.376 --> 16:01.877
I gave it some thought.

16:01.877 --> 16:06.382
If that thing is a biological tank,
then it must be operated by nerves.

16:06.382 --> 16:10.761
Even the command to open the hatch
must come from the nerves.

16:10.761 --> 16:14.515
So I thought if that's the case,
maybe it can be destroyed

16:14.515 --> 16:18.519
by bursting the nerves,
with the poison of a mandrake.

16:20.396 --> 16:23.857
<i>Dakai had stolen one of the poison blades</i>

16:23.857 --> 16:26.860
<i>that Higuare would hide inside his body.</i>

16:27.444 --> 16:30.698
<i>His unworldly observational power</i>

16:30.698 --> 16:33.367
<i>is even capable of spotting
the flow of nerves.</i>

16:33.951 --> 16:38.080
<i>Through this observation, he had confirmed
where to induce malfunction</i>

16:38.080 --> 16:43.335
<i>and which part of the brain to target
with the poison that acts on nerves</i>

16:43.335 --> 16:45.838
<i>in order to unlock the hatch.</i>

16:46.422 --> 16:50.759
<i>The cut made by Soujirou the Willow-Sword</i>

16:50.759 --> 16:54.805
<i>turned out to be a keyhole
for Dakai the Magpie.</i>

16:57.099 --> 17:00.185
You really do like to chat,
don't you?

17:00.185 --> 17:02.563
Aren't my conversations interesting?

17:03.647 --> 17:05.065
Perhaps they are...

17:43.562 --> 17:46.315
H-Higuare...

17:46.315 --> 17:47.566
was killed.

17:48.734 --> 17:50.069
<i>Was it the World Word?</i>

17:51.236 --> 17:55.074
Was that the power of the World Word?

17:56.533 --> 17:57.910
Huh?

18:06.251 --> 18:08.670
<i>They were strong too.</i>

18:10.047 --> 18:13.175
<i>We had to overcome them to save Aureatia.</i>

18:13.717 --> 18:16.428
<i>Yet they were killed so easily...</i>

18:27.648 --> 18:31.819
<i>Monsters that trample over others
like trash shouldn't be allowed to exist.</i>

18:52.339 --> 18:54.925
Lana, what are you doing?

18:58.554 --> 19:00.556
Elea. Kia.

19:08.772 --> 19:10.941
This is too awful.

19:12.192 --> 19:13.443
The place is full of monsters.

19:18.073 --> 19:20.242
I'll destroy it all!

19:20.784 --> 19:21.827
Lana!

19:23.328 --> 19:25.581
This city and the rest of you in it!

19:25.581 --> 19:27.916
I should just blow it all away
with the Cold Star!

19:27.916 --> 19:29.501
Somebody...

19:29.501 --> 19:32.296
Somebody has to or it will never end!

19:32.296 --> 19:33.380
Lana!

19:39.720 --> 19:40.888
Stop!

19:46.768 --> 19:47.769
Disperse.

19:56.653 --> 19:58.488
Calm down, Lana.

19:59.072 --> 20:02.743
You're probably so scared
that you can't think straight.

20:02.743 --> 20:05.162
You're not acting like the Lana I know.

20:05.162 --> 20:06.914
Isn't that right?

20:13.462 --> 20:17.299
All this horror is the reason.

20:19.384 --> 20:20.886
Professor.

20:20.886 --> 20:25.432
You said my power was meant
to make people happy, didn't you?

20:26.516 --> 20:28.393
Kia, stop!

20:29.478 --> 20:30.896
You mustn't reveal your power!

20:35.984 --> 20:37.152
Vanish.

20:51.792 --> 20:52.960
Lana...

20:52.960 --> 20:55.796
...there's nothing to be afraid of now.

20:56.171 --> 20:58.006
W-Who...

20:58.006 --> 21:00.008
Who are you two?

21:00.008 --> 21:01.176
Lana.

21:01.843 --> 21:03.512
Let's go home.

21:08.225 --> 21:09.226
Do you...

21:10.435 --> 21:12.312
Do you plan to kill me?

21:12.312 --> 21:14.898
Please don't. I beg you.

21:15.482 --> 21:17.234
Kia is watching.

21:17.234 --> 21:19.486
Lana, um...

21:21.446 --> 21:24.783
The truth is,
I'm capable of anything.

21:27.202 --> 21:28.787
I'm sorry for keeping it a secret.

21:29.788 --> 21:33.542
I'm sorry for not being able
to save your city sooner.

21:34.710 --> 21:37.546
Though she may be a monster,

21:37.546 --> 21:42.551
you want to be
a kind and beautiful professor, don't you?

21:44.720 --> 21:45.721
Please.

21:51.977 --> 21:53.061
Lana.

22:00.277 --> 22:01.361
There's no way

22:02.279 --> 22:05.032
this professor would do anything
to hurt you.

23:36.665 --> 23:38.750
Translated by Zacarias Hicks

23:39.376 --> 23:40.836
Episode 11
When the Sun Sets
